{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOHeading"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Foundations"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Sizes","type":"heading","text":"Sizes","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"XLarge"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The largest heading, useful for page titles."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Large (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The default heading. Only this size supports the marker and the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"colored substring"}]},{"type":"text","text":" feature."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Medium"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A medium heading, typically used for section titles."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Small"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The smallest heading, used for subsection titles."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Marker","type":"heading","text":"Marker","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some themes (like "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BlueCoat"}]},{"type":"text","text":") declare that a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"large"}]},{"type":"text","text":" heading is decorated with a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"coloured rectangle below the text, i.e. the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"marker"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Other themes may not use a marker at all but something else."}]},{"anchor":"Coloring-a-substring","type":"heading","text":"Coloring a substring","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated initializer accepts a "},{"code":"coloredText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" sub-string instead of a marker."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is useful to emphasize a specific word inside a heading (for example a brand name). This feature is only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"meaningful for "},{"code":"size == .large","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; on other sizes a warning is logged and the text is rendered plain."}]},{"style":"warning","name":"Warning","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Not all themes provide a valid "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"theme.colors.contentBrandSecondary"},{"type":"text","text":" (some themes may mark"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the token as forbidden). When the token is forbidden the coloring is skipped."}]}]},{"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Simple raw string","    MISOHeading(text: \"Title\")","","    \/\/ Large heading with a marker (rendered only when the theme supports it)","    MISOHeading(text: \"Section title\", size: .large, hasMarker: true)","","    \/\/ Smaller heading (marker parameter would be ignored here)","    MISOHeading(text: \"Sub-section\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Heading with a brand-coloured word","    MISOHeading(text: \"Welcome to MISO\", coloredText: \"MISO\")","","    \/\/ Localizable from a bundle","    MISOHeading(LocalizedStringKey(\"section_title\"), bundle: Bundle.module, size: .large)"]},{"anchor":"Accessibility","type":"heading","text":"Accessibility","leve